  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "0.2.0: admin user creation (POST /users/by-admin, with invitation or forced password change) and IUserProvisioningService to create users from your own code together with your linked entity; per-method registration switches and optional admin approval; default role for every new user; refresh token in an HttpOnly cookie and an optional reuse grace window; ITwoFactorStepUpService to verify an Authenticator code before sensitive actions; permission sync from code; security fixes around email verification and refresh. Includes breaking changes and one schema change (Users.MustChangePassword): read the Breaking section before upgrading. Full history: https://github.com/frugocorp/AutoDiscoveryIAM/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md",
